	"Description": "The mods add new items you can buy at Pierre's, once you place them they will start creating their intented item and you will be able to collect them anytime they are ready.\n<br />\n<br />Right now there are 3 mods you can download: Milking, Futanari Milking, Egg Laying\u00A0[i](and an old version of the futa one)[/i]\n<br />All the updated versions are compatible, the non updated versions will have a huge DEPRECATED in the files section so it should be easy to notice\n<br />In case you don't know how to install mods you can read a brief explanation in the [i]readme[/i] file of the mod\n<br />\n<br />If you experience any problem or bug, contact with us in the \"Posts\" or \"Bugs\" section\n<br />\n<br />[i]If you get offended by this type of content, please close this window and don't disturb anyone. Thank you.\n<br />\n<br />Please do not redistribute this mod without permission[/i]",
